All,

We have gotten to the bottom of the CMF Insurance Policy.

See the attached CMF Certificate of Insurance.  This is just standard busin=
ess insurance held by CMF.  We have such a policy as well and can produce a=
 certificate of insurance just as they have.  In fact our customers have al=
ways had this coverage whether or not we provide them a certificate or not.=
  All other companies serving products into this market have this as well.

This is CMF trying to get something for nothing.  Again.

We will be firming up some details and providing you guidance for the futur=
e.

John

